{"query_id": "C-001", "teaching_concept": "absent_model_identifier", "query": "I need a replacement charging brick for model A2342", "expected_confidence": "unanchored", "expected_unmatched_terms": ["A2342"], "floor_dependent": false, "verified_against_catalog": true, "measured": {"measured_on": "2026-09-04", "cluster": "aurora mosaic_catalog, 500,000 products", "similarity_floor": 0.24, "confidence": "unanchored", "unmatched_terms": ["A2342"], "terms": [{"token": "I", "kind": "asciiword", "ndoc": 0, "verdict": "ignored"}, {"token": "need", "kind": "asciiword", "ndoc": 1, "verdict": "matched"}, {"token": "a", "kind": "asciiword", "ndoc": 0, "verdict": "ignored"}, {"token": "replacement", "kind": "asciiword", "ndoc": 0, "verdict": "recoverable", "closest": "refinement", "similarity": 0.353}, {"token": "charging", "kind": "asciiword", "ndoc": 24003, "verdict": "matched"}, {"token": "brick", "kind": "asciiword", "ndoc": 0, "verdict": "recoverable", "closest": "bridge", "similarity": 0.3}, {"token": "for", "kind": "asciiword", "ndoc": 0, "verdict": "ignored"}, {"token": "model", "kind": "asciiword", "ndoc": 0, "verdict": "recoverable", "closest": "mode", "similarity": 0.571}, {"token": "A2342", "kind": "numword", "ndoc": 0, "verdict": "unmatched_anchor"}]}, "rationale": "The reported failure. The only term carrying identity matches nothing: search_fts drops it at the EXISTS in salient-term selection, and rank-based fusion cannot carry the loss forward. Measured 2026-09-04: 'replacement', 'brick' and 'model' also match zero documents -- the 500,000-product corpus never uses those words -- and are rescued as recoverable, so the verdict rests on 'A2342' alone, as intended, but not for the reason first written here."}
